Construction,
    Adiabatic Floor,         !- Name
    floor stud and cavity,   !- Outside Layer
    floor rigid ins,         !- Layer 2
    osb sheathing 0.75 in.,  !- Layer 3
    floor covering;          !- Layer 4

Construction,
    First floor ceiling,     !- Name
    ceiling loosefill ins,   !- Outside Layer
    ceiling stud and cavity, !- Layer 2
    gypsum board;            !- Layer 3

Construction,
