    gypsum board,            !- Outside Layer
    ceiling stud and cavity, !- Layer 2
    ceiling loosefill ins;   !- Layer 3

Construction,
    Adiabatic Floor Reverse, !- Name
    floor covering,          !- Outside Layer
    osb sheathing 0.75 in.,  !- Layer 2
    floor rigid ins,         !- Layer 3
    floor stud and cavity;   !- Layer 4


